# Cloudflare cache purge — copy to .env (never commit .env)
# Token: dash.cloudflare.com → My Profile → API Tokens → Create → "Edit zone cache" (Zone: todaysdailybattle.com)
# Optional: CF_ZONE_ID= (script auto-discovers zone if unset)
CF_API_TOKEN=
#
# After deploy or OG/meta/asset changes, purge edge cache:
#   npm run purge:cloudflare:social   # targeted HTML + share JPEGs + kids URLs
#   npm run purge:cloudflare          # full zone (use sparingly)
# Or: GitHub → Actions → "Purge Cloudflare Cache" (set CF_API_TOKEN + CF_ZONE_ID in repo secrets)
#
# Optional: ElevenLabs cloud Listen (Pages Functions only — not used by local static preview unless you wire a proxy).
# Set in Cloudflare Dashboard → Workers & Pages → your project → Settings → Variables, or:
#   wrangler pages secret put ELEVENLABS_API_KEY
#   wrangler pages secret put ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID
# Never commit real keys. Voice ID: ElevenLabs dashboard → Voices → copy ID for your chosen preset.
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=
# List likely “Southern” / baritone presets (local only): npm run elevenlabs:list-voices
